{"id":"667731dfcb4ea62d44f1d1c3","slug":"margaret-evangeline-san-antonio-orange","title":"San Antonio Orange","artists":["Margaret Evangeline"],"date":"2024","medium":"Oil on Canvas","dimensions":"48 × 48 in","image":"yCkIfiLyYGOmNziPAk6Hog","c":["#9b9680","#5b4f30","#a14f1e"],"said":[{"k":"note","q":"The work, which reflects the landscape, draws on the notion of place, reality, and space as a medium, as visitors are confronted by both ethereal distortions of their surroundings and focused glimpses of the material place itself within the bullet holes on the piece’s mirrored surface. Evangeline further elaborated on the notion of space in a 2008 commission by Illuminate Productions, for which she created a site-specific installation on the River Thames, opposite the Tate Modern in London.","by":"Ferrara Showman Gallery, on Artsy"}],"events":[{"k":"made","y":"2024","q":"2024","o":1,"s":[0]},{"k":"listed","y":"2024-06-26","who":"Ferrara Showman Gallery","n":"listed by the gallery","ll":[29.9449,-90.0677],"w":"New Orleans, US","p":"new-orleans-us","pr":"office","o":3,"s":[0]},{"k":"exhibited","y":"2024-07-18","e":"2024-08-31","t":"Margaret Evangeline: Inner Gardens","v":"Ferrara Showman Gallery","ll":[29.9449,-90.0677],"w":"New Orleans, US","p":"new-orleans-us","pr":"venue","o":2,"s":[0],"x":[0]}],"sources":[{"name":"Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/margaret-evangeline-san-antonio-orange"}],"threads":[{"id":"f5fa2eee","k":"show","name":"Margaret Evangeline: Inner Gardens","at":"Ferrara Showman Gallery, New Orleans","y":2024,"ll":[29.9449,-90.0677],"n":1},{"id":"31473dca","k":"artist","name":"Margaret Evangeline","y":2024,"n":4}],"asof":"2026-10-01"}